Yoshi vs. Monsters!

v0.4 March 29, 2011

by Elsie, Charlie & Ben Schomp


A PyGame Space Invaders-type game featuring
Yoshi from the Mario games and the monsters
from Monsters, Inc.

Play on desktop (Python 3):
  pip install pygame-ce
  python3 yoshi.py

Play in a browser:
  pip install pygbag
  pygbag --ume_block 0 .     (then open http://localhost:8000)

Pushing to master builds the browser version and
publishes it to GitHub Pages (.github/workflows/deploy-web.yml).

Enjoy!
